## Steam Launch Options

# Any
Launch with gamemode
gamemoderun %command%

# Baldur's Gate III
Skip launcher:
--skip-launcher --vulkan/--dx11
Launch with mods:
WINEDLLOVERRIDES="DWrite.dll=n,b" %command%

# Elden Ring
Launch in fullscreen:
gamescope -W 1920 -H 1080 -f --force-grab-cursor -- %command%

# Fear & Hunger
Enable steam overlay:
--in-process-gpu

# Fear & Hunger: Termina
Enable steam overlay:
--in-process-gpu

# Sons of the Forest
Launch with mods:
WINEDLLOVERRIDES="version=n,b" %command%
